  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FY 24-25 ASEAN ELTO 61 In-Country</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Activity aims to develop the English language capabilities of 48 Officials from Cambodia, Indonesia, Lao PDR, Viet Nam, Timor-Leste and Mongolia. It consists of preparation in-country, followed by&#xa0;a 13 week programme in&#xa0;New Zealand to cement language skills and relationships.
This course will commence in May 2025.</narrative>
  </description>
